RODNEY BARNES:
Welcome back to the official
<i>Winning Time Podcast</i> from HBO!

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:13.480
I'm Rodney Barnes,
executive producer on the show.

00:00:13.746 --> 00:00:16.783
REPORTER:<i> Magic and the Lakers
are back to defend their title.</i>

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.117
REPORTER 2:
<i> What a time to be alive.</i>

